Z||000003||007DOUG||08-28-2000||11:22 PM||||I was just at the carlisle corvette show.<P>While wandering through the vette vendors, I noticed that vette seats have a lumbar option very close to the fiero.<P> Actually, each vesion of the lumbar seat seems to have a differnt switch/valve. Perhaps the bladder, and maybe even a switch could be installed.<P>Someone correct me, but the info I have is 841 lumbar fieros in 88. <P>------------------<BR>4 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>84 SE<BR>86 SE V6 153K<BR>2 86 GT's<BR>86 GT 3.4 Pearl White T-top<BR>2 88 GT twins<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||6
